''Tie ~ apertures, not tiers.'' The living-grammar memory-palace ([[living-grammar-palace|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/living-grammar-palace]]) selects a
retrieval APERTURE (turn → session → arc) where this model selects a THERMAL tier (wela/anu) — adjacent
scale-axes, kept distinct.

''Tie ~ one integrity, three grains.'' `wela`/`anu` enacts at the BAG grain the same pattern integrity
TW5's `skinny`/`fat` enacts at the TIDDLER grain and the skinny handle enacts at the BODY grain — //carry
the name, defer the body// ([[hydration-grain|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/hydration-grain]]). The
vocabularies stay distinct (they name different layers); the integrity stays legible across them. That
reading names the rung the bag grain LACKS — a cheap read before the CRDT hydrates — which enters only
through #third-tier-gate, and only after the research that meme charges.

<<~/ahu>>

